* [EDD Landing Pages for Categories and Tags](https://www.pluginsandsnippets.com/downloads/edd-landing-pages-for-categories-and-tags/?utm_source=docs&utm_medium=installation_tab&utm_content=documentation&utm_campaign=readme) transforms your download category and tag pages into real landing pages by allowing you to insert more text and images to these pages. Included is a text editor and an additional text field below the list of downloads by category and tags. Also, other features such as better sorting and filtering are added.
* [EDD Mailchimp Abandoned Cart](https://www.pluginsandsnippets.com/downloads/edd-mailchimp-abandoned-cart-wordpress-plugin/?utm_source=docs&utm_medium=installation_tab&utm_content=documentation&utm_campaign=readme) plugin triggers an email automation series in Mailchimp when customers abandon their carts to systematically follow up on lost orders via Mailchimp. The plugin allows for the recovery of lost sales and improves store conversion.
* [EDD FES Vendor Statistics](https://www.pluginsandsnippets.com/downloads/edd-fes-statistics/?utm_source=docs&utm_medium=installation_tab&utm_content=documentation&utm_campaign=readme) adds a sales statistic page to the Vendor Dashboard to make it easier for the vendors to understand and monitor monthly commissions earned.
* [EDD Requests](https://www.pluginsandsnippets.com/downloads/edd-requests-plugin/?utm_source=docs&utm_medium=installation_tab&utm_content=documentation&utm_campaign=readme) plugin helps you to trigger more engagement with your visitors by offering them a contact button on the download product and author page where they can quickly submit requests for assistance and upload attachments. Requests are added and tracked via separate lists in the vendor and admin dashboards to ensure systematic follow-ups.

